      "created_at": "2026-02-14T15:24:03Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-02-14T15:24:28Z",
      "body": "Well, it is an intentional design to tolerate nulls downstream, and by default,t it's a good choice.\n\nMy alternative approach and suggestion would be to make strict inference an option for catching nulls early on, and to use relaxed inference as the default.",
